 "notes": "Producer ReportLab 5.0.1 low-level canvas, no Platypus: every string is a separate drawString call and the table grid is drawn from line/rect calls. Helvetica, Helvetica-Bold, Helvetica-Oblique, standard-14, NOT embedded. Page 1 has the letterhead (three strings, with a drawn green square as logo); page 2 has the running header 'Statement of account · March 2026 · continued'. The account summary is a key/value box (no header row: rows are [label, value]). The transactions table is ONE table continued over the page break with its header row repeated; 'Opening balance' and 'Closing balance' are rows of it; empty money out / money in cells are empty strings. The footnote line '* Interest is calculated daily at 1.85% a year and paid monthly.' is not a key sentence. The three bullets under 'Important information' are drawn circles, not text, so the list items carry no marker. The pound sign is U+00A3."
